- op: discuss  # de50
  at: '2026-07-05T07:11:11Z'  # de50
  by: agent  # de50
  actor: jgstern_agent  # de50
  clock: 3  # de50
  nonce: de50  # de50
  message: "Fixed in PR (dev 1b044cbf6f). Root cause: nim.py proc/func/method/type processors resolved the name via find_child_by_type(node,'identifier'), missing Nim's exported form 'proc name*' where tree-sitter wraps the name in an exported_symbol node (identifier + '*') — so every exported declaration hit 'if not name_node: return None' and was dropped (0/246). Fix: shared _declared_name_node helper resolves the inner identifier for both plain and exported_symbol shapes and returns is_exported, threaded through _make_symbol to Symbol(is_exported=). Exported procs/funcs/methods/types now extracted + marked is_exported=True; non-exported stay False (mirrors go.py lexical-case export rule). Structural note: the dispatch handles proc/func/method/type only; template/iterator/const are a separate pre-existing non-extraction. Behavioral evidence (analyze_nim): greet*/double*/speak*/Person* extracted with is_exported=True, plain 'internal' with False (was: only internal extracted). extended package 100% coverage; 26 nim tests pass."  # de50
